[0.212822, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H"]
[0.213089, "o", "1. Run the fixture demo\r\n\r\nActual execution. Dependency and test logs are captured privately.\r\n$ ./scripts/demo.sh --state-dir var/recording-ux96i6u2/state\r\n"]
[61.685886, "o", "Selected output:\r\n"]
[61.685994, "o", "Test suite: OK (231 tests in 54.069 seconds)\r\nAccounts: 30\r\nCall-note scope denial: HTTP 403\r\nInjected-note activities: 0\r\nIdempotent write: 2 requests, 1 activity\r\n"]
[71.687265, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H"]
[71.687444, "o", "2. Read the cited renewal conflict\r\n\r\nThree exact lines from the demo's acc-003 brief:\r\n"]
[71.687464, "o", "- CRM opportunity opp-003: stage \"closed_won\"; amount USD 25,500.00; close date 2027-01-10. [crm/opportunities/opp-003]\r\n"]
[71.687565, "o", "- Untrusted call note note-003 at \"2027-01-12T15:00:00Z\" says \"Procurement has not approved this renewal. The budget remains unsigned.\". [calls/call_notes/note-003]\r\n"]
[71.687641, "o", "- Source conflict: CRM opportunity opp-003 reports stage \"closed_won\", while call note note-003 reports unapproved procurement. [crm/opportunities/opp-003] [calls/call_notes/note-003]\r\n"]
[71.959996, "o", "Citation checker: valid.\r\n"]
[81.964806, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H"]
[81.964962, "o", "3. Keep missing permission visible\r\n\r\n"]
[81.965003, "o", "Recorded response excerpt for a CRM-only grant:\r\n"]
[81.965078, "o", "{\r\n  \"status\": 403,\r\n  \"message\": \"insufficient_scope: calls:read required\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[81.96508, "o", "Exact line from the restricted brief:\r\n"]
[81.965102, "o", "- Call notes were unavailable because the token lacks calls:read. [audit/bb651321-0921-4d3d-9eac-96b220cd3b6c]\r\n"]
[91.970904, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H"]
[91.970918, "o", "4. Reject an uncited sentence\r\n"]
[91.970975, "o", "\r\n"]
[91.971993, "o", "Candidate: the generated brief plus 'The renewal was approved.'\r\n$ .venv/bin/python -m gtm_connector check-brief brief-6fae6c87ef324720a20a1ab074d46f58 var/recording-ux96i6u2/candidate.txt --state-dir var/recording-ux96i6u2/state\r\n"]
[92.240545, "o", "error: Brief contains an uncited, unsupported, or misattributed statement.\r\nExit: 2. Standard output is empty.\r\n"]
[102.245549, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H"]
[102.245576, "o", "5. List tools through the official Inspector CLI\r\n\r\n"]
[105.294498, "o", "Fixture backend. Fresh loopback TLS server and an explicit crm:read grant.\r\n"]
[105.294555, "o", "$ npx --yes @modelcontextprotocol/inspector@2.15.0 --cli --config var/recording-ux96i6u2/inspector-state/inspector.json --server gtm-connector --stored-auth-only --quiet --format json --method tools/list\r\n"]
[106.642104, "o", "Name and required-scope projection of the actual Inspector JSON:\r\n"]
[106.642175, "o", "{\r\n  \"search_accounts\": \"crm:read\",\r\n  \"get_account\": \"crm:read\",\r\n  \"list_opportunities\": \"crm:read\",\r\n  \"read_call_notes\": \"calls:read\",\r\n  \"read_slack_messages\": \"slack:read\",\r\n  \"log_activity\": \"crm:write\"\r\n}\r\nSix tools returned by Inspector CLI.\r\n"]
